# Private development documentation
# Keep public user/contributor documentation directly under docs/. Put local
# plans, drafts, reviews, handoffs, and generated evidence in one of these
# ignored directories so they can never be included in a GitHub push.
**/docs/internal/
**/docs/development/
**/docs/drafts/
**/docs/plans/
**/docs/reviews/
**/docs/superpowers/
**/docs/.private/
